You already had enough practice to enhance twoweapon before you got
the message, but you had no skill slots.  Then, when in dragon form,
you killed the vampire.  This gave your human incarnation enough XP to
get to the next level, giving you enough skill slots to enhance
twoweapon.

If you ever look at the #enhance screen and see a skill with a *
beside it, that means you have enough practice, but not enough skill
slots to #enhance that skill to the next level.

